# The devshell (flake.nix's devShells.default), entered on cd by direnv. Use nix-direnv's
# `use flake`: it caches the environment, re-evaluating only when flake.nix or flake.lock change,
# and makes it a GC root, so a nix-collect-garbage can't delete store paths the environment names
# (the test programs, Kani, glibc's static archives) under it. Without direnv: `nix develop -c`.
use flake
